ِتَابٌ ، الْفَضْلُ (Ek kitaab, Fazl) → ذَٰلِكَ كِتَابٌ ، ذَٰلِكَ الْفَضْلُ (Woh ek kitaab hai • Woh/Yahi bada fazl hai).</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Unit 1 mein aasaan Qur'ani alfaaz aur buniyadi ishaare/qawa'id sikhaye gaye hain.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Pages 44–45):** **`ذَٰلِكَ`** ka matlab **'Woh'** (aur azmat ya ta'keed ke liye **'Yeh / Yahi'**) hota hai: `ذَٰلِكَ كِتَابٌ` (Woh kitaab hai), `ذَٰلِكَ الْفَوْزُ الْعَظِيمُ` (Yahi badi kamyaabi hai).",
