    {
      "id": "sec_s1l16_r5",
      "type": "rule_paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "Guftagu mein (ذٰلِكَ) aam taur par door ki cheez ki taraf ishaarah karne ke liye istemal hota hai, lekin Quran-e-Kareem mein yeh aksar qareeb ki cheez ke liye bhi 'yeh' (this) ke ma'na mein aata hai. Upar diye gaye jumlon ka tarjuma aapne 'woh' se kiya hai, ab inhein 'yeh' ke ma'na mein samajhein jaise ﴿ذٰلِكَ خَيْرٌ﴾ 'Yeh behtar hai'.",
